$ plumber explain BOGUS
exit: 2
--- stdout

--- stderr
Usage:
  plumber explain [ISSUE-CODE | -a N] [flags]

Flags:
      --all               Show detailed information for all issue codes
  -a, --attack string     Print attack path N of the last analyze run, with its findings (N or all)
  -h, --help              help for explain
      --json              Output in JSON format
      --list              List all issue codes with short descriptions
      --project string    With --attack: read the last cached run of this project (owner/repo) instead of the last run
      --provider string   With --attack --project: the provider of the project ('github' or 'gitlab') when both have a cached run
      --run string        With --attack: read this JSON report (written by analyze --output) instead of the cache

Global Flags:
  -v, --verbose   Enable debug logging on stderr (level=debug); replaces the progress bar

Error: unknown issue code: BOGUS

Run 'plumber explain --list' to see all available issue codes

